{"meta":{"id":"version-control","category":"aide/common-rules","title":"버전관리 (.bak 대신 git)","subtitle":"","summary":".bak·버전 폴더·zip 대신 커밋/태그, 커밋하지 않는 생성물, ?v= 캐시 무효화, 실행 안내는 한 곳에서","tags":["aide","규칙","git"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-indigo","source":"aide_agents/1-rules","updatedAt":"2026-10-18"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>1-rules</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2026-10-18</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">버전관리 (.bak 대신 git)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/70 border border-indigo-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> .bak·버전 폴더·zip 대신 커밋/태그, 커밋하지 않는 생성물, ?v= 캐시 무효화, 실행 안내는 한 곳에서</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">원칙</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">이전 상태는 파일 이름이 아니라 커밋으로 남긴다</strong> — <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>.bak_날짜</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>html_v04 → html_v05</code> 폴더 복사, zip은 diff·이유·어느 파일끼리 한 묶음인지를 잃는다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">원격 저장소가 없어도 된다 — <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>git init</code>만 해도 로컬 이력·diff·되돌리기가 생긴다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">크게 바꾸기 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">직전에 커밋</strong>(비교 기준) — 비교할 때 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>git show HEAD~1:graph.js</code></span></div></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">이렇게 바꾼다</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">지금 하는 것</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">대신</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">이유</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>파일.bak_날짜_태그</code> 복사</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">커밋 (태그 내용은 커밋 메시지로)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>.bak_*</code> 15개 — 어떤 bak끼리 같은 시점인지 알 수 없다</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">버전 폴더 복사</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">태그 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>v04</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>v05</code> / 같이 띄워 비교는 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>git worktree add ../v04 v04</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">폴더마다 같은 버그 수정을 따로 해야 한다</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">zip으로 시점 보관</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">태그 / 브랜치</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">열어 보기 전엔 내용·차이를 모른다</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">비교용 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>_old.js</code> 남기기</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>git show 태그:파일 &gt; 임시경로</code> 후 비교, 끝나면 삭제</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">비교용 파일이 산출물과 섞인다</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">이미 쌓인 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>.bak</code>·버전 폴더·zip은 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">오래된 것부터</strong> 그 시점 파일로 커밋·태그하고, 마지막에 현재 상태 커밋 → 확인 후 삭제</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>.gitignore</code>에 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>*.bak</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>*.bak_*</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>*.zip</code></span></div></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">커밋하지 않는 것</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">대상</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">대신 남길 것</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">생성 데이터(DB에서 뽑은 수 MB json)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">만드는 명령과 순서(README), 결과 안 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>generated_at</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">내보낸 파일(단독 HTML, 리포트)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">파일명에 조건 + 시각 — <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>7-standalone-export</code>의 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>fileName()</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">스키마·설정 JSON</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">커밋한다</strong> — 사람이 쓰는 파일. 생성 데이터와 같은 폴더에 두지 않는다</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">캐시 무효화 (`?v=`)</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">정적 서버(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>python -m http.server</code>)는 캐시 헤더가 없어 예전 JS·CSS가 쓰일 수 있다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>?v=</code>는 한 페이지의 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">모든 참조를 같이</strong> 올린다 — 하나만 올리면 새 JS + 옛 CSS</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">값은 날짜·태그·커밋 해시 앞자리처럼 커밋과 대응하는 것으로</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">개발 중엔 개발자 도구 &quot;캐시 사용 중지&quot;로 충분 — <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>?v=</code>는 다른 사람에게 넘길 때</span></div></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">실행 안내는 한 곳에서</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">폴더명·포트·명령 순서를 도움말, 로드 실패 문구, README에 각각 쓰면 어긋난다 — 한 곳에 쓰고 나머지는 가리키거나 같은 상수(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>const RUN = { port: 9324 }</code>)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">폴더명은 안내에 쓰지 않는다(&quot;이 폴더에서&quot;) — 옮기거나 복사해도 틀리지 않게</span></div></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">체크리스트</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">☐ 작업 폴더가 git 저장소인가, 큰 교체 직전에 커밋했는가</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">☐ <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>.bak</code>·버전 폴더·zip을 새로 만들지 않았는가</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">☐ 생성 데이터는 커밋하지 않고, 만드는 명령이 README에 있는가</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">☐ <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>?v=</code>를 한 페이지 안에서 같이 올렸는가, 실행 안내가 한 곳에만 있는가</span></div></div></div>\r\n","path":"aide/common-rules/version-control","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"aide","title":"aide","path":"aide"},{"id":"common-rules","title":"1-rules (공통 규칙)","path":"aide/common-rules"}],"hasImage":false}